  "body": "**Description:**\r\n\r\nUsers should be able to define macros/scripts that would output events that would appear as if authored by themselves, with using as input the state of rooms that they are a member. Those self-bots otherwise may be left indistinguishable from normal user action.\r\n\r\nAlternatives: Using a maubot/maubot session only replying to self.",
